{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bit Buddy</strong> reacts in real-time to your keyboard and mouse activity. Every click and movement brings an adorable response from your little companion. Even better, each interaction gives you a chance to unlock new decorations, with no extra effort required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>100+ unique accessories and pet skins</strong> to collect and customize, you can give your Bit Buddy a one-of-a-kind look that matches your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Buddy automatically logs your daily and historical keyboard and mouse activity, so you can easily track how much you\u2019ve typed or clicked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working or studying, <strong>Bit Buddy</strong> stays by your side on your screen\u2014your loyal digital coworker, always there with you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3874950?t=1755892651","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/53a37308f3e466fa81cb16752037c3b528c1177b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755892651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/63acb7f078c497ba918be85e903c6511eec7b54b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755892651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/63acb7f078c497ba918be85e903c6511eec7b54b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755892651","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3950450,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bit Buddy</strong> reacts in real-time to your keyboard and mouse activity. Every click and movement brings an adorable response from your little companion. Even better, each interaction gives you a chance to unlock new decorations, with no extra effort required!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>100+ unique accessories and pet skins</strong> to collect and customize, you can give your Bit Buddy a one-of-a-kind look that matches your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit Buddy automatically logs your daily and historical keyboard and mouse activity, so you can easily track how much you\u2019ve typed or clicked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're working or studying, <strong>Bit Buddy</strong> stays by your side on your screen\u2014your loyal digital coworker, always there with you.</p>","developers":["Joe Zane"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3874950/b7fcc6770a1b2531bdc40bcf5a93ab641c01675a/header.jpg?t=1755892651","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257185742,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185742/movie480.mp4?t=1755892649","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185742/movie_max.mp4?t=1755892649"},"name":"bit buddy","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257185742/3445b32fa98773a8e68f146dbc47e9b1db5b9fee/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755892649","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185742/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755892649","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257185742/movie_max_vp9.webm